## User

The layer-matrix **User** element: the minimal assignment identity (name, email, initials-avatar renders in every format). This card pre-existed in the realm (consumed by blog-post, sprint-task, task); the Revenue OS work added its formats and made it the base for flavored extensions.

**Type Owner fields against this base, not a flavor:**

```ts
import { User } from '../user';
@field owner = linksTo(User);
```

Card adoption makes the link polymorphic — a `Teammate` (or any future subtype: agent, contractor) satisfies an `owner` slot. `Teammate` (`../teammate`) extends User with `jobTitle` and richer format overrides; see its Spec.

**Non-goals:** authentication, permissions, Matrix identity — assignment record, not an auth principal. Org structure belongs to Team/Role.
